      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "だから、作業する場所だけ救出しよう。小さい島を作る感じ。",
      "translatedText": "So rescue only the place where you work. Like making a small island.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "gazeTarget": "player" },
